spaCy and spacy-lookups-data — MIT
Copyright (c) ExplosionAI GmbH
https://github.com/explosion/spaCy
https://github.com/explosion/spacy-lookups-data

The English tokenizer's prefix/suffix/infix rules and special cases, and the
lexeme_norm table. The tokenizer implementation in Sources/PresidioNLP is
ported from spaCy.

  Sources/PresidioNLP/Resources/en_tokenizer.json
  Sources/PresidioEngine/Resources/en_lemma_lookup.json

