Unicode Character Database — Unicode License
Copyright (c) 1991-2024 Unicode, Inc.
https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html

Character-class membership tables (\w, \d, \s) generated from Python's `regex`
module, which derives them from the UCD. Generated by
Tools/unicode_classes_python.py and pinned so behaviour cannot drift with the
host platform's Unicode version.

  Sources/PresidioRegex/UnicodeTables.swift

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Yams and libyaml — MIT
Copyright (c) 2016 JP Simard
Copyright (c) 2006-2016 Kirill Simonov, 2017-2020 Ingy dot Net
https://github.com/jpsim/Yams

A dependency of PresidioEngineYAML only, for reading a user's own recognizer
configuration. Yams vendors libyaml's C source (built with YAML_DECLARE_STATIC),
so no system library is required. Both are MIT; neither is redistributed here in
source form -- SwiftPM fetches them.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Presidio configuration files — MIT
Copyright (c) Presidio Contributors

Presidio's own YAML configuration files, copied verbatim so the YAML reader is
tested against real configurations rather than ones written to suit it. Includes
the deliberately malformed fixtures its error tests use.

  Tests/PresidioConformance/Fixtures/conf/*.yaml

